# Per-cluster overrides. Rendered into the ConfigMap "policy-config-local-cluster";
# any key set here wins over the same key in global.env, for this cluster only.
#
# The filename must be the ManagedCluster name, not the conf.yaml cluster name.
# For the hub those differ: clusters/mgt/acm-hub/conf.yaml calls it "acm-hub",
# but ACM registers the hub as "local-cluster", and the policy plane only ever
# sees the ManagedCluster name.
#
# Empty today -- the hub takes the fleet defaults. Adding a key here is the whole
# per-cluster mechanism; nothing else needs to change.
